# 1. Re-testing After a Bug Fix – Flipkart Add to Cart

**Feature selected:** Flipkart Add to Cart

After a bug in the Add to Cart feature is fixed, I would re-test the same area to make sure the reported problem is actually solved.

| Test Case | Test Steps                                                                  | Expected Result                                                                             |
| --------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| TC01      | Open a product, select the required size/variant and click **Add to Cart**. | The product should be added to the cart successfully.                                       |
| TC02      | Add the same product to the cart again.                                     | The cart should handle the duplicate product correctly without creating an incorrect entry. |
| TC03      | Add a product and open the cart from the cart icon.                         | The correct product, quantity and price should be displayed in the cart.                    |

**Conclusion:**
These test cases directly check the Add to Cart functionality that could have been affected by the bug fix.

