# 3. Regression Test Suite – Music App Search

**Module:** Search feature of a music streaming app such as Spotify

Whenever the search functionality is updated, I would run these regression tests to make sure existing features still work.

| Test Case | Test                                           | Expected Result                                                              |
| --------- | ---------------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
