| TC03      | Search using partial words.                    | Relevant search suggestions/results should appear.                           |
| TC04      | Search with incorrect spelling.                | The app should provide useful results or suggestions instead of crashing.    |
| TC05      | Select a song from search results and play it. | The selected song should start playing correctly.                            |
| TC06      | Clear the search and perform another search.   | The previous search results should be removed and new results should appear. |
| TC07      | Search while using filters/categories.         | The selected filter should work correctly with the search results.           |

**Conclusion:**
This regression suite checks both the search function and the features connected to it, such as playing a song and using filters.

